# Torch packages are data, not code: they live in the torches repository,
# checked out here as the torches/ submodule. Nothing torch-shaped belongs in
# this repository — see CLAUDE.md, "Where torches live".

# uv is not this project's dependency manager (pyproject.toml + pip, see
# CLAUDE.md); a lock file here is a local side effect of `uv pip install`.
uv.lock

# Local scratch space for throwaway artifacts
.scratch/